  { "id": "int-tan", "front": "(HL) Find $\\int\\tan x\\,dx$.", "back": "$\\int\\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos x}\\,dx = -\\ln|\\cos x| + C = \\ln|\\sec x| + C$ (form $-\\frac{f'}{f}$).", "concept": "Integrals", "kind": "derivation" },
